.nh
.TH "GMB" "1" "Sep 2026" "GlassMarble 1.2.0" "GlassMarble Manual"

.SH NAME
gmb-doc-review - List or resolve human-review items (conflicts, fixes, ADR drafts)


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgmb doc review [approve|reject]  [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
The D6 review queue holds items needing a human decision: merge
conflicts, applied snippet fixes, and auto-generated ADR drafts.
With no arguments, lists pending items. Approve or reject by ID.
With --tuning, prints prompt/style suggestions aggregated from resolved
outcomes; --apply (requires --tuning) additionally applies the SAFE subset
(style suggestions naming a jargon term are appended to the docs.yaml
style.jargon_blacklist, everything else is reported as manual-action).


.SH OPTIONS
\fB--apply\fP[=false]
	Apply safe tuning suggestions (requires --tuning; style jargon only)

.PP
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for review

.PP
\fB--reason\fP=""
	Reason recorded with approve/reject

.PP
\fB--stats\fP[=false]
	Show review queue counts

.PP
\fB--tuning\fP[=false]
	Show prompt/style tuning suggestions from resolved outcomes


.SH OPTIONS INHERITED FROM PARENT COMMANDS
\fB--color\fP="auto"
	Color output mode: auto|always|never

.PP
\fB-c\fP, \fB--config\fP=""
	Config file path (default is $HOME/.glassmarble.yaml)

.PP
\fB--debug\fP[=false]
	Enable debug logging

.PP
\fB--dir\fP=""
	Target repository directory for analysis and queries

.PP
\fB--max-json-mb\fP=0
	Refuse to load or commit an AKG state file (akg.json) larger than this many MiB (0 = unlimited)

.PP
\fB-q\fP, \fB--quiet\fP[=false]
	Suppress non-error output

.PP
\fB-v\fP, \fB--verbose\fP[=false]
	Verbose output logging


.SH EXAMPLE
.EX
  gmb doc review
  gmb doc review approve r1a2b3c4d --reason "looks right"
  gmb doc review reject r1a2b3c4d --reason "wrong callers"
  gmb doc review --stats
  gmb doc review --tuning
  gmb doc review record-revert --doc docs/auth.md --section intro --reason "human rewrote the table"
.EE


